     A* Line and page positioning: skip, space, and relative position.
     A* Member: PRTPOS   Compilable: yes
     A* Source: IBM i 7.5 DDS for printer files, Example: A printer
     A*   file using DDS. Retrieved: 2026-07-25
     A*
     A* SKIPB advances to a line before printing, SKIPA after.
     A* A record using skip or space keywords may not also use
     A* line numbers in columns 39-41.
00010A          R HEADER                    SKIPB(2)
00020A                                    29'CUSTOMER MASTER FILE'
00030A                                    75DATE EDTCDE(Y)
00040A                                    +1TIME
00050A                                   122'Page'
00060A                                    +1PAGNBR  EDTCDE(Z)  SPACEA(2)
     A*
     A* SPACEB spaces before printing, SPACEA after.
00070A          R SPACING
00080A                                     2'ACCOUNT  CUSTOMER'
00090A                                      SPACEA(1)
00100A                                      SPACEB(1)
00110A                                      SKIPA(3)
     A*
     A* A relative position, +n, places the field n columns after
     A* the end of the previous one.
00120A          R DETAIL                    SPACEA(5)
00130A            ACTNUM    R              2
00140A            NAME      R             +4
00150A            ADDR      R             +3
00160A            CITY      R             +3
00170A            ZIP       R             +5
